msgid ""
"During the weekend, your RIM Personal Weekend Support subscription gives "
"you unlimited connection time for keyword-based sessions, in addition to "
"your RIM Personal subscription's support for unattended sessions."
msgstr ""
"Durante el fin de semana, su suscripción a la Asistencia de fin de semana"
" de RIM Personal le ofrece tiempo de conexión ilimitado para sesiones "
"basadas en palabras clave, además de la asistencia de su suscripción a "
"RIM Personal para sesiones desatendidas."

msgid ""
"During the weekend, your RIM Personal Weekend Support subscription gives "
"you unlimited connection time for keyword-based sessions."
msgstr ""
"Durante el fin de semana, su suscripción a la Asistencia Personal de Fin "
"de Semana de RIM le ofrece tiempo de conexión ilimitado para sesiones "
"basadas en palabras clave."

msgid ""
"You currently have %{remaining_base_time_today} of base RIM connection "
"time today, from both the free tier and your RIM Personal Community "
"Support subscription, and %{remaining_credited_time} of prepaid time. RIM"
" will use your base time first."
msgstr ""
"Actualmente dispone de %{remaining_base_time_today} de tiempo de conexión"
" básico de RIM, tanto del nivel gratuito como de su suscripción a la "
"comunidad de soporte personal de RIM, y %{remaining_credited_time} de "
"tiempo prepago. RIM utilizará primero tu tiempo base."

msgid ""
"You currently have %{remaining_free_time_today} of free RIM connection "
"time today and %{remaining_credited_time} of prepaid time. RIM will use "
"your free time first."
msgstr ""
"Actualmente dispone de %{remaining_free_time_today} de tiempo de conexión"
" RIM gratuito hoy y %{remaining_credited_time} de tiempo prepago. RIM "
"utilizará primero su tiempo gratuito."

msgid ""
"You currently have %{remaining_base_time_today} of RIM connection time "
"today, from both the free tier and your RIM Personal Community Support "
"subscription."
msgstr ""
"Actualmente dispone de %{remaining_base_time_today} de tiempo de conexión"
" a RIM en la actualidad, tanto del nivel gratuito como de tu suscripción "
"al servicio de asistencia de la comunidad personal de RIM."

msgid ""
"You currently have %{remaining_free_time_today} of free RIM connection "
"time today."
msgstr ""
"Actualmente dispone de %{remaining_free_time_today} de tiempo de conexión"
" RIM gratis hoy."

msgid ""
"You have used up all of your base RIM connection time for today, from "
"both the free tier and your RIM Personal Community Support subscription, "
